    bpm:opDoc "`{\"op\":\"align_trace\",\"net_handle\":n,\"trace\":[...][,\"options\":...]}` -- aligns ONE plain activity-name trace against an imported/discovered net (standard optimal alignments; the discount exponent is UNSUPPORTED and refused engine-side, never faked)." ;
    bpm:opTimeoutClass bpm:TimeoutClass_heavy ; bpm:opKind bpm:EngineOpKind_wire .
