    bpm:opDoc "`{\"op\":\"ocel_dfg_of_object_type\",\"ocel_handle\":h,\"object_type\":t}` -- object-centric DFG for one object type (`get_dfg_of_object_type` over `SlimLinkedOCEL`), sorted by count desc then (from, to) -- the crate's own ordering." ;
