bap:engine_ferroplan_op_plan_production a bpm:EngineOp ;
    bpm:opEngine bap:engine_ferroplan ; bpm:opName "plan_production" ; bpm:opOrder 2 ;
    bpm:opDoc "`{\"op\":\"plan_production\",\"domain\":d,\"problem\":p[,\"mode\":m,\"search\":s,\"max_evaluated\":n,\"max_plan_steps\":n,\"max_output_bytes\":n,\"request_id\":id]}` -- bounded production solve: strict mode/search parsing, a versioned `OperationEnvelope` response, always candidate-only. A strict-mode refusal arrives as `{:ok, envelope}` with its own `outcome`, never a bare `{:error, _}` (bpm:ErrorCollapse_single_key_inspect)." ;
